  interactionCompleteLines:
  - Aha!
  - Well, I hope the path ahead is a little clearer for you now.
  - Farewell, traveler!
  nightTimeLines:
  - Aha!
  - 'You''ve come to hear my song! '
  - 'Here we go! '
  dayTimeLines:
  - Aha!
  - Another traveler!
  - I bet you've come to hear me play!
  - Well, that's too bad!
  - I can't play my flute without the crackling of a campfire to accompany me.
  - And everybody knows you can't just light a campfire in the middle of the day!
  - Come back this evening!
  nightStartTime: 19
  nightEndTime: 5
  playFluteTrigger: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 24e070dde7520fc4bb0e6bfd54ac417d, type: 2}
  openGateTrigger: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f13c8be4cb1cf344a91894585663ba04, type: 2}
